---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Domestic Package Shipping Company in Concord Township, OH | Mailbox Plus"
  description="Local domestic package shipping company in Concord Township (44077). UPS, FedEx, USPS & DHL shipping, business accounts, volume discounts, and professional packing. 5.0★ from 32 reviews. Call (440) 709-1946."
>
  <script is:inline type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "Service",
      "name": "Domestic Package Shipping",
      "description": "Local domestic package shipping company in Concord Township. UPS, FedEx, USPS & DHL shipping, business accounts, volume discounts, and professional packing.",
      "areaServed": {
        "@type": "Place",
        "name": "Concord Township, OH",
        "address": {
          "@type": "PostalAddress",
          "addressLocality": "Concord Township",
          "addressRegion": "OH",
          "postalCode": "44077",
          "addressCountry": "US"
        }
      },
      "provider": {
        "@type": "LocalBusiness",
        "name": "Mailbox Plus",
        "legalName": "Mailbox Plus of Ohio, LLC",
        "address": {
          "@type": "PostalAddress",
          "streetAddress": "7554 Fredle Drive",
          "addressLocality": "Concord Township",
          "addressRegion": "OH",
          "postalCode": "44077"
        },
        "aggregateRating": {
          "@type": "AggregateRating",
          "ratingValue": "5.0",
          "reviewCount": "32"
        }
      },
      "offers": {
        "@type": "Offer",
        "name": "Domestic Package Shipping",
        "priceCurrency": "USD",
        "priceRange": "Starting at $8.99"
      }
    }
  </script>

  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-8 text-[var(--color-primary)]">
      Domestic Package Shipping Company in Concord Township, OH
    </h1>

    <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary-dark)]">
          Your Local Domestic Shipping Partner
        </h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-3 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
          <li>Compare rates across UPS, FedEx, USPS & DHL at one counter</li>
          <li>Business accounts and volume shipping discounts</li>
          <li>Professional packing for fragile and valuable items</li>
          <li>Real-time tracking for every shipment</li>
          <li>Insurance options for high-value packages</li>
          <li>Same-day processing for most shipments</li>
          <li>Free package drop-offs for pre-labeled returns</li>
          <li>5.0-star rating from 32 verified Google reviews</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] mt-4">
          Whether you're a small business shipping daily orders or an individual sending a gift across the country, Mailbox Plus provides reliable domestic package shipping with personal service you won't find at national chain stores.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary-dark)]">
          Why Businesses Choose Mailbox Plus
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="border rounded-lg p-4">
            <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Multi-Carrier Rate Comparison</h3>
            <p class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">We check UPS Ground vs. FedEx Ground vs. USPS Priority Mail versus DHL Express — and recommend the best balance of speed and cost.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border rounded-lg p-4">
            <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Volume Shipping Discounts</h3>
            <p class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">Regular shippers get preferred rates. Ask about our commercial pricing program for businesses shipping 5+ packages per week.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border rounded-lg p-4">
            <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Professional Packing Included</h3>
            <p class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">Our team packs items to carrier standards so your shipment is insurance-ready. No more rejected claims due to improper packing.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border rounded-lg p-4">
            <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Local Expertise</h3>
            <p class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">We know the best shipping routes and carrier quirks for Concord Township and all of Lake County, Ohio.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 border-t pt-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary-dark)] mb-6">
        Frequently Asked Questions
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="border rounded-lg p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">What carriers do you ship with?</h3>
          <p class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">Mailbox Plus is an authorized shipper for UPS, FedEx, USPS, and DHL. We can ship with any of these carriers and help you choose the best option.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border rounded-lg p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Do you offer business accounts?</h3>
          <p class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">Yes! We work with businesses of all sizes. Volume discounts are available for regular shippers with no monthly minimums.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border rounded-lg p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">How long does domestic shipping take?</h3>
          <p class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">Transit times vary by carrier and service level: UPS Ground 1-5 days, FedEx Ground 1-5 days, USPS Priority Mail 1-3 days. Overnight options are also available.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border rounded-lg p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Can you ship to PO boxes?</h3>
          <p class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">Only USPS can deliver to PO boxes. For PO box destinations, we'll recommend USPS Priority Mail. For all other addresses, we can use any carrier.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 text-center">
      <a href="tel:4407091946" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[var(--color-primary)] text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-md hover:bg-[var(--color-primary-dark)] transition-all">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 01-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 01-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 01-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 01-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 014.11 2h3a2 2 0 012 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 00.7 2.81 2 2 0 01-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 006 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 012.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 002.81.7A2 2 0 0122 16.92z"/></svg>
        Get a Domestic Shipping Quote: (440) 709-1946
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>